00:06:41.117 --> 00:06:42.887
Hello Peter.

00:06:42.947 --> 00:06:47.359
I need some flowers for our best room.

00:06:47.419 --> 00:06:50.382
Ten hours on the telephone.

00:06:50.441 --> 00:06:51.873
That's a long time.

00:06:51.933 --> 00:06:53.704
