00:07:08.606 --> 00:07:09.998
Flowers.

00:07:10.058 --> 00:07:12.010
I've got lots of flowers.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.480
Thanks, Peter.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.696
Therefore, an important TV star.

00:07:16.756 --> 00:07:19.250
He's coming here today.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:20.792
What's that?

00:07:20.852 --> 00:07:23.024
Your green car?

00:07:23.083 --> 00:07:25.035
No, Peter.

00:07:25.095 --> 00:07:25.996
No.

00:07:26.056 --> 00:07:30.890
A TV star here today.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:32.732
OK, Mr Harris.

00:07:32.792 --> 00:07:33.833
Don't shout.

00:07:33.893 --> 00:07:35.214
Don't shout.

00:07:35.274 --> 00:07:41.942
I can hear you.

00:07:42.002 --> 00:07:52.683
