00:07:52.743 --> 00:07:57.006
In the corridor.

00:07:57.066 --> 00:08:01.399
Mary, can you help me?

00:08:01.459 --> 00:08:04.771
Take these flowers to Tony's room, please.

00:08:04.831 --> 00:08:08.014
I've got this new light for the room.

00:08:08.074 --> 00:08:09.994
Do you like it?

00:08:10.054 --> 00:08:12.686
The new light is green.

00:08:12.746 --> 00:08:16.155
It has yellow and red flowers on it.

00:08:16.215 --> 00:08:20.884
Oh, George, it's horrible.

00:08:20.944 --> 00:08:23.346
