00:08:23.406 --> 00:08:24.607
Yes, I can.

00:08:24.627 --> 00:08:27.468
I think it's beautiful.

00:08:27.528 --> 00:08:31.240
I like it and I'm going to put it up now.

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.092
Can you help me?

00:08:33.152 --> 00:08:35.874
Oh, all right.

00:08:35.934 --> 00:08:40.276
Give me the flowers.

00:08:40.336 --> 00:08:45.390
