00:09:01.476 --> 00:09:02.746
Careful.

00:09:02.766 --> 00:09:05.587
There.

00:09:05.647 --> 00:09:06.927
Ouch!

00:09:06.987 --> 00:09:10.268
You're standing on my hand.

00:09:10.328 --> 00:09:12.728
Hold the ladder, Mary.

00:09:12.788 --> 00:09:13.829
Don't go.

00:09:13.849 --> 00:09:17.435
Mary.

00:09:17.496 --> 00:09:22.403
He falls off the ladder.

00:09:22.423 --> 00:09:32.157
Oh, my head!

00:09:32.217 --> 00:09:38.110
