00:11:21.285 --> 00:11:22.788
No.

00:11:22.848 --> 00:11:26.624
Yes, very much.

00:11:26.684 --> 00:11:28.744
Yes, I do too.

00:11:28.804 --> 00:11:32.306
I like film's best.

00:11:32.366 --> 00:11:35.738
She laughs.

00:11:35.798 --> 00:11:38.268
Here's your key.

00:11:38.328 --> 00:11:40.810
Your room is number five.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.050
