00:13:49.286 --> 00:13:53.668
Oh, hello, hello.

00:13:53.728 --> 00:13:54.778
Welcome.

00:13:54.838 --> 00:13:55.728
Hello.

00:13:55.788 --> 00:13:56.929
Thank you.

00:13:56.989 --> 00:13:58.180
Thank you.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:13:59.771
Thank you.

