00:16:30.831 --> 00:16:32.222
I'm very sorry.

00:16:32.242 --> 00:16:34.544
Oh, it's all right.

00:16:34.604 --> 00:16:36.292
It isn't important.

00:16:36.352 --> 00:16:37.861
I can wash my jeans.

00:16:37.921 --> 00:16:40.052
I'm sorry, Mr. Brown.

00:16:40.112 --> 00:16:42.224
