What can I get for you?

00:21:57.586 --> 00:22:02.290
I'd like some chicken, please, Mr. Harris.

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:06.113
All right, Mrs. Uh, all right.

00:22:06.173 --> 00:22:07.584
Don't shout.

00:22:07.644 --> 00:22:10.687
I'm sorry, Mr. I'd like a blast.

