Would you like some champagne now?

00:22:15.414 --> 00:22:16.897
It's free.

00:22:16.957 --> 00:22:19.478
No thanks, a glass of water, please.

00:22:19.538 --> 00:22:21.918
Please have some champagne.

00:22:21.978 --> 00:22:24.609
No, no, I don't like champagne.

00:22:24.669 --> 00:22:28.780
I'd like a glass of water, please.

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:32.131
George goes to the woman's table.

00:22:32.191 --> 00:22:33.831
He is angry.

00:22:33.891 --> 00:22:37.462
Mrs. My name is Adams.

00:22:37.522 --> 00:22:39.203
Miss Adams.

00:22:39.263 --> 00:22:40.852
Miss Adams.

