00:25:19.956 --> 00:25:22.837
Miss Maddock, here you are.

00:25:22.898 --> 00:25:24.478
Please stay.

00:25:24.538 --> 00:25:27.220
You can have the room for nothing.

00:25:27.279 --> 00:25:28.600
Free.

