00:27:20.438 --> 00:27:22.248
Don't thank me.

00:27:22.308 --> 00:27:24.889
Thanks, Silio, George.

00:27:24.949 --> 00:27:29.760
Would you like a glass of champagne now, Miss Maddock?

00:27:29.820 --> 00:27:31.980
