00:27:32.040 --> 00:27:34.516
George is lying on the floor.

00:27:34.577 --> 00:27:36.753
He slowly opens one eye.

00:27:36.774 --> 00:27:45.941
She's very, no, she's very, very famous.

00:27:46.001 --> 00:27:49.264
